The DrayOS 5 web API wire format (request encoding, login, DSL status field
names) follows the documentation and implementation of draytek_exporter by
Ben Kochie (https://github.com/SuperQ/draytek_exporter), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. No source code was copied; the protocol was
reimplemented in Python.

The DrayTek-specific interpretation of the ADSL-LINE-MIB tables (ATU-C =
downstream, ATU-R = upstream, values in whole dB) follows the findings of
ha-draytek by Marc Frederick (https://github.com/marcfrederick/ha-draytek),
Apache License, Version 2.0.

The web session handling (log out before logging in again, log out on
shutdown) incorporates lessons from ha-draytek-vigor by Sebastian Kornehl
(https://github.com/skornehl/ha-draytek-vigor), MIT License.

